            "review_title": "Review at Carlito's Fried Chicken",
            "review_text": "johnbeattie2015\nHong Kong, China82 contributions\n0\nLittle out of the way fried chicken shop.\nOct 2017 • Couples\nWhen it says fried chicken it really is that. Wings and chips and some sauces. The pub is in a old style high ceiling house, and the day we went the power was off so the beer was not freezing. The menu as mentioned is very limited, but it is a comfortable friendly little bar and well worth a visit. I saw the board and breakfast looked like a winner. PS the chicken was OK, hardly great but as a nibble with your drinks it was fine.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 23, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
