            "review_title": "Review at Carlito's Fried Chicken",
            "review_text": "Tracey\nMelbourne, Australia286 contributions\n0\nMeal deal well worth it!\nSep 2017 • Couples\nMy partner was craving chicken and after some searching on the net, he came across this place. Between the (very hungry) two of us, we ordered 3 meal deals that comes with chicken, salad, potato fries, cheese sauce and a drink. Chicken was cooked well and the cheese sauce was delicious with the potato chips! The owner, Carl, had delivered it to our hotel aswell. Carl was very friendly and professional and offered advice on where to visit while in Da Nang. All the best Carl!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 26, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
