            "review_title": "Review at Carlito's Fried Chicken",
            "review_text": "Francois\nDa Nang, Vietnam22 contributions\n0\nSimply fantastic!!\nSep 2017 • Family\nLocated on a small street, Carl and his lovely family run this fantastic place and they make an incredible delicious and tasty fried chicken served with fresh and simply perfect potatoes!! With only 5$ you can get a full menu' which includes chicken, potatoes, the special cheese sauce and a delicious salad!! What can I ask more??....of course a beer which is free with this combo!!!!!\nRead more\nWritten September 1, 2017",
